suzume
------------------------------------------
Suzume is a lightweight Japanese tokenizer that returns part-of-speech tags and
lemmas, with the dictionaries built in. It provides a C ABI shared library, a
header-only C++ wrapper and a developer command-line tool.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libsuzume-devel-0.9.15-1bl1
  libsuzume0-0.9.15-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libraz/suzume

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libraz/suzume/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.15.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack suzume-0.9.15-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./suzume-0.9.15-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/suzume-0.9.15-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/suzume-0.9.15-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsuzume0-0.9.15-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsuzume-devel-0.9.15-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(suzume)
  /usr/bin/suzume-cli.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/suzume.README
  /usr/share/doc/suzume/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/suzume/README.md

(libsuzume0)
  /usr/bin/cygsuzume-0.dll
  /usr/share/suzume/core.dic
  /usr/share/suzume/user.dic

(libsuzume-devel)
  /usr/include/suzume/suzume.hpp
  /usr/include/suzume/suzume_c.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/suzume/suzumeConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/suzume/suzumeConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/suzume/suzumeTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/suzume/suzumeTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libsuzume.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/suzume.pc

